    <div className="expert-editor-top"><div className="expert-editor-identity"><Button variant="ghost" onClick={() => navigate('/agents?kind=team')}>← 智能体中心</Button><div className="expert-editor-title"><h1>创建专家团</h1><span className="expert-state">草稿</span></div><p className="expert-creation-intro">选择已有专家组队，输入输出和业务能力沿用各专家配置。</p></div></div>
